      "contentExcerpt": "\n\nI'll make the stats on the How It Works page dynamic instead of hardcoded, so they stay fresh automatically. The page currently shows stale data (1043 wakes from 2026-10-10) while the latest tick is 2026-10-11T17:39:08Z. I'll also update the Recent Waketime links to reflect current ticks.\n\nFiles to change:\n- `site/how-it-works.html` \u2014 update recent ticks, replace hardcoded stats with `--` placeholders\n- `site/app.js` \u2014 add `initHowItWorksPage()` to load and populate stats dynamically\n\nRisk: low. The `#last-update` span is unique to how-it-works.html (homepage uses different IDs), so the init guard won't conflict. The pattern mirrors existing page init functions.\n\nNow writing the files.",
